s  scheduled for april 8 2022  marvel's thor franchise has been  thrilling fans around the globe for over  a decade  the witty god of thunder will return to  the big screen again next year for what  is now his fourth movie  after the pandemic upset the plans to  start filming in 2020 the time was right  to begin shooting thor love and thunder  in australia at the start of this year  the plot centers on the one hand on thor  himself as he loses the ability to lift  mjolnir  however the focus will be more on  another character namely dr jane foster  mighty thor as she is also called is  worthy of lifting thor's hammer and  henceforth becomes the mighty goddess of  thunder  in principle the two have similar powers  but it is said that there will be some  subtle differences as well  in front of the camera we can look  forward to chris hemsworth as thor  natalie portman as jane foster tessa  thompson as valkyrie and christian bale  as gore the god butcher among many other  familiar faces the release date of thor  love and thunder is set for may 6 2022  the action in john week 4 promises to be  very intense  you don't need to be a clairvoyant to  suspect that this time around we'll be  dealing with a rather angry john wick he  and the bowery king are out for revenge  against the high table the continental  and of course his manager winston  featured on screen will be keanu reeves  as john wick lawrence fishburne as the  bowery king  ian mcshane as winston and lance reddick  as the concierge charon one newcomer is  japanese british pop star arena sabayama  who like martial arts legends donnie yen  and scott atkins is expected to take on  an unspecified role likewise joining the  cast in recent weeks and months have  been marco zero hiroyuki zanada chemier  anderson clancy brown and bill skosgod  this is absolutely a cast to be excited  about  john wick chapter 4 will be released on  may 27 2022 in the united states  in june we can look forward to the  conclusion of an extremely successful  film series with the release of jurassic  world dominion the hype is huge although  the date of the release is still several  months in the future one contributing  element is certainly the return of some  of the actors from the 1993 original as  laura dern jeff goldblum and sam neal  will be seen together on the big screen  for the first time in years other  returning actors who will be seen  alongside chris pratt and the like  include bd wong as dr henry wu justice  smith as franklin webb and omar sai as  barry samban director colin trevorrow  further revealed that the 1993 stars  will have about as much screen time as  those in the jurassic world trilogy thus  nostalgic should get their money's worth  not much is known about this story yet  now that macy lockwood has released all  the dinosaurs there are many  possibilities as to which direction  jurassic world dominion could take  is it more in terms of coexistence  between humans and dinosaurs or are the  prehistoric creatures a massive threat  to humanity after all  should this be the case  how will the beasts be dealt with  jurassic world dominion will hit cinemas  on june 10 2022  after jurassic world dominion in june  the action continues with the  transformers rise of the beasts  as the name suggests the seventh  installment in the film series will be  the first live action film to focus on  the beast wars saga  the movie will be set in 1994 seven  years after the events of bumblebee  the setting is new york city brooklyn  respectively where the plot is supposed  to have a lot of connections to the  local hip-hop scene  epic transformers battles will not only  take place there though because part of  the story also plays out in machu picchu  in peru  center of attention is once again fan  favorite optimus prime who is again  being dubbed by peter cullen to the joy  of many fans  in the movie he will not only fight  against the familiar decepticons  together with his autobots since he must  also face the new threat posed by the  terrorcons and the maximals all in all  you can expect an action-packed movie  that will take the same direction as the  michael bay films as producer lorenzo di  buenaventura promises transformers rise  of the beasts will be released in  theaters on june 24 2022  exactly one week later minions the rise  of growth follows the sequel to the  extremely successful predecessor from  2015 was actually supposed to be  released in 2020 but was then postponed  along with many other productions  and in terms of content the film is said  to be an origin story involving the  villain grew  the focus will be on his first time  meeting up with the minions when he  saved them from scarlet  most of the plot will be set in the  1970s where gru then still 12 years old  made his first plans to become the  greatest villain of all time as in the  predecessor the terrific cast around the  dubbing actors will provide the right  atmosphere  the cast includes steve corrales grew  and pure coffin as kevin stewart bob and  rookie otto also featured will be the  vicious six featuring taraji p hanson as  bell bottom michelio as master  and danny trejo as stronghold  allegedly the group's former leader wild  knuckles will also make his return  the director will be called baldo while  the screenplay will be provided by  writer brian lynch  minions the rise of crew will be  released on july 1 2022  another week later is the release of  black panther wakanda forever the latest  mcu adventure not only has to cope with  the painful loss of chadwick boseman but  also tie in with its highly successful  forerunner what is clear is that there  will not be a new king t'challa instead  disney wants to expand the black panther  universe and introduce new characters  one of them is iron heart to whom a  separate series will also be dedicated  later often referred to as ironman's  successor riri williams is a student at  the renowned mit and quite skilled at  crafting new armor and weapons we will  get to see the new villain namor who  along with the other new additions will  let us dive a bit deeper into the  mythological world of wakanda  fortunately many actors from the first  park celebrate their return for instance  leticia ride as shuri lupita nyong'o as  nakia winston duke as baku and angela  bassettes ramonda  especially shuri will be given a  significant spotlight according to  reports another attorney is martin  freeman scia agent everett ross  new to the cast is michael cole in as  yet unknown role as well as the  initially mentioned reary williams who  will be portrayed by dominic thorne once  again ryan coogler will be in charge of  directing the movie while marvel boss  kevin feige will be the producer black  panther wakanda forever will be released  on the big screen on july 8 2022.  the fifth part of the legendary indiana  jones series awaits us in the same month  in spite of initial skepticism on the  part of harrison ford who is now 79  years old and doubts whether the project  would ever be continued the crew finally  decided to bring indiana jones 5 to the  big screen after all  after discussions about the casting of  the main character harrison ford  clarified that there could be no indiana  jones without him which is why the  veteran actor is returning to his  signature role along with him we will  see much mickelson phoebe walla bridge  boyd holbrook toby jones thomas  scratchman and chenette renee wilson on  the screen each in as yet unknown roles  unfortunately nothing is known about the  plot yet we only know that the director  will no longer be steven spielberg but  james mangald the expected release date  for indiana jones 5 is july 29th 2022  on the same day the shazam spin of black  adam will be released  for many the eponymous anti-hero may not  be as well known as other colleagues  from the dc universe but the hype around  him is at least as great  the story of black adam is a spin-off to  shazam from 2019 and is expected to be a  much gloomier film than the latter black  adam's real name is that adam who is the  son of an egyptian pharaoh and an  extremely violent contemporary  the justice society of america and its  four representatives will also be  playing a role  dwayne johnson will take on the role of  the titular anti-hero while pierce  brosnan will be seen as dr fate noah  centineo as atom smasher eldest hodges  hockman  sarah shahi as adriana thomas and  contessa swindell as cyclone  jungle troops director jean-colisera is  responsible for directing and the script  is by adam stikel rory haynes and  saurabh noshervani  dc's black adam will be released in  theaters on july 29 2022  in late september 2022 mission  impossible 7 will then be released tom  cruise who is still a very vigorous 49  year old will once again take on the  role of ethan hunt for the seventh time  the upcoming blockbuster is a direct  sequel to mission impossible fallout and  will be brought to the screen by  director christopher mcquarrie once more  little is known about the content sadly  but we can nevertheless speculate that  things will heat up the reason for this  assumption is not only the franchise  reputation but above all the stunts that  cause quite a sensation during filming  take for example the gigantic ramp from  which tom cruise jumps on the motorcycle  and then opens his parachute at the very  last moment mcquarrie feels the same way  speaking about it in the podcast of the  us magazine empire stating that the  helicopter's done for mission impossible  fallout will look pretty dull in  comparison to the new stuns whether this  is really the case can be seen starting  on september 30th 2022  in october the next movie will be  spider-man into the spider-verse 2.  miles morales second adventure has been  in production since summer 2020 and is  expected to be as popular as its  predecessor  this is probably going to be difficult  to achieve given that the first  multiverse spectacle even won an oscar  for best animated film the content of  the second part will be similar to that  of the previous one since miles has met  several spider-friends from different  universes in addition the focus will be  on the romantic relationship between  miles and quinn which was somewhat  neglected in the prequel according to  producers chris miller and floyd silk  aka cindy moon and spider-punk will also  make their way into the sequel in  addition to the countless spider-man and  spider-woman also generating excitement  is a hint from the teaser video that  suggests that takuya yamashiro aka  spiderman will also be featured in the  movie  there's news about the voice actors as  well at least the most important of  which will return  these are shamiq more as miles morales  hailey steinfeld as gwen stacy and luna  loren the less as miles mother rio along  with probably brian tyree henry as  mild's father jefferson davis  last but not least jake johnson has also  confirmed that he will once again voice  mild mentor peter b parker the latter  will be particularly exciting to see  grow after all his fate was quite open  at the end of the first part  the trio of goalkeeping dos santos camp  powers and justin k thompson will direct  the movie while the screenplay will be  handled by david callahan phil lord and  chris miller  the release day for spider-man into the  spider-verse 2 is scheduled for october  7th 2022  in mid-october just before halloween the  third and final part of david gordon  green's trilogy remake will be released  halloween ants will once again provide  major scares in 2018 the series kicked  off with halloween which is by the way a  direct successor to the 1978 original  completely ignoring all other sequels  and spin-offs in doing so the production  team has absolutely succeeded as hardly  any other horror film remake is as  highly anticipated in 2021 as the second  part of the trilogy halloween kills  which will be released on october 15th  this year  pretty much exactly one year later  halloween ants will follow even though  nothing is known yet about the plot and  the cast it is fairly easy to figure out  from the film's title what the final  part will be about it is considered  certain that laurie and her brother  michael myers will face each other for  one last final showdown on the other  hand director green revealed that  halloween ends could be something that  fans don't have in mind at all in terms  of content in any case we are excited  and look forward to the theatrical  release on october 14th 2022  the next movie the flash is due to be  released in november up to now the dc  project has been known for having worn  out many directors it wasn't until  november 2019 that the wright man was  found namely it director andy muschietti  this is particularly interesting since  musketeer obviously comes from the  horror genre and it is believed that the  upcoming flash will also go in a  somewhat creepier direction  details about the plot are still lacking  but there are some clues that give us an  idea of the plot  the flashpoint event from the dc comics  is the main focus  broadly speaking the flashpoint occurs  when perry allen travels back in time  causing the timeline to plunge into  chaos as a result michael keaton's  batman and many other characters could  make an appearance  what exactly this might look like is  something you will be able to find out  from november 4th 2022  we're slowly approaching the end of 2022  but this doesn't mean there will not be  any more blockbusters watch out because  the release of james cameron's avatar 2  is coming in mid-december the action  takes place about 12 years after the  first part sully is now the clan leader  supported by his wife nathiri of course  emphasis is to be put on the underwater  world of pandora which is in danger due  to exploitative missions of the rda  despite being a sequel according to  cameron the movie stands on its own and  can therefore be watched by newcomers to  the franchise without prior knowledge  fans who already know the predecessor  will be happy to see some familiar faces  the cast includes sam worthington zoe  zaldana matt gerald giovanni ripsey and  many more new additions to the cast are  kate winslet as rona cliff curtis as  tonal warri and eddie falcone as general  art moore the release date for avatar 2  has been set for december 16th 2022  on the same day the last big movie of  the year will finally come out namely  aquaman and the lost kingdom recently  known primarily by boycott calls many  nonetheless have high expectations for  the sequel according to reports aquaman  in the last kingdom will be  significantly more complex than the  first part the plot is still largely  undisclosed though we do already know  some of the cast members of course jason  momoas aquaman amber heard asmera  patrick wilson has ocean master and yaya  tomodi in the second as black manta in  particular the villain black manta is  expected to take a major role in the  sequel fans can also hope for some  horror elements since director is none  other than horror movie icon james 1. as  already stated the end result can be  seen right before christmas starting on  december 16 2022  well so much for our second part of the  most anticipated films of 2022 which  movie are you looking forward to the  most or have we even forgotten an  essential film you're looking forward to  feel free to tell us in the comments and  don't forget to activate the  notification bell after all you never  know when the next trailer for your  favorite movie will be available on our  channel  [Music]
 

